doctype html
html(lang="id")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport", content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title Reset Password - GeoSandbox
  body(style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #fef08a; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #000000;")
    table(role="presentation", width="100%", cellspacing="0", cellpadding="0", style="background-color: #fef08a; padding: 40px 15px;")
      tr
        td(align="center")
          table(role="presentation", width="100%", style="max-width: 580px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 4px solid #000000; box-shadow: 8px 8px 0px #000000; overflow: hidden;", cellspacing="0", cellpadding="0")
            
            tr
              td(style="background-color: #a78bfa; border-bottom: 4px solid #000000; padding: 32px 30px; text-align: left;")
                h1(style="margin: 0; color: #000000; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900; uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.5px;") GeoSandbox
                p(style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: #000000; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; background-color: #ffffff; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 8px; border: 2px solid #000000; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #000000;") Permintaan Atur Ulang Kata Sandi
            
            tr
              td(style="padding: 36px 32px;")
                h2(style="margin: 0 0 16px; color: #000000; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase;") Atur Ulang Kata Sandi Akun Anda
                p(style="margin: 0 0 24px; color: #000000; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;")
                  | Halo, kami menerima permintaan untuk mengatur ulang kata sandi (reset password) akun Anda di 
                  strong(style="background-color: #fed7aa; padding: 2px 4px; border: 1px solid #000000;") GeoSandbox
                  | . Silakan klik tombol di bawah ini untuk membuat kata sandi baru:
                
                table(role="presentation", cellspacing="0", cellpadding="0", style="margin: 28px 0;")
                  tr
                    td(align="center" style="background-color: #22c55e; border: 3px solid #000000; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #000000;")
                      a(href=resetLink, target="_blank", style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #000000; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;") Reset Password Sekarang
                
                div(style="background-color: #f1f5f9; border: 3px dashed #000000; padding: 18px 20px; margin: 32px 0; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #000000;")
                  p(style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; color: #000000;") Atau gunakan Token Reset Password berikut:
                  div(style="background-color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 14px; border: 2px solid #000000; font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #000000; word-break: break-all; user-select: all;")= token
                
                div(style="background-color: #ffedd5; border: 3px solid #000000; padding: 16px 18px; margin: 32px 0; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #000000;")
                  p(style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #000000; text-transform: uppercase;") 🔒 Keamanan &amp; Batas Waktu:
                  p(style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 500;")
                    | Tautan dan token ini hanya berlaku selama 
                    strong(style="text-decoration: underline;") 15 menit
                    |  dan hanya dapat digunakan 
                    strong(style="text-decoration: underline;") 1 kali
                    | . Jangan pernah memberikan token ini kepada siapa pun.
                
                p(style="margin: 32px 0 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #000000;") Jika tombol di atas tidak dapat diklik, salin tautan berikut ke browser:
                p(style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; word-break: break-all; background-color: #ffffff; border: 2px solid #000000; padding: 12px; font-family: monospace; color: #2563eb;")
                  a(href=resetLink, style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 700;")= resetLink
            
            tr
              td(style="background-color: #ffffff; border-top: 4px solid #000000; padding: 24px 32px; text-align: center;")
                p(style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 13px; color: #000000; font-weight: 500;") Jika Anda tidak merasa meminta reset password, abaikan email ini dan akun Anda tetap aman.
                p(style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #000000; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;") &copy; #{new Date().getFullYear()} GeoSandbox. Seluruh hak cipta dilindungi.
